{"ID":"20240506100116-giplk3m","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100116-giplk3m","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100116-giplk3m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100116-w80yhsv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100116-w80yhsv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100116-w80yhsv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"251黍米","type":"doc","updated":"20240821191812"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627134500-cmophml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627134500-cmophml","updated":"20240627134500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 494px;","style":"width: 484px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黍米"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黍米-20240627134500-4ivuvb1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 484px;\" parent-style=\"width: 494px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 495px;","style":"width: 485px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627140830-vtsbd96.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 485px;\" parent-style=\"width: 495px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627143147-ty8j045","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627143147-ty8j045","updated":"20240821191350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 415px;","style":"width: 405px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黍米8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黍米8-20240627143133-2ih2awa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 405px;\" parent-style=\"width: 415px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 793px;","style":"width: 783px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黍米5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黍米5-20240627142757-5ct52ed.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 783px;\" parent-style=\"width: 793px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240821191452-yhcffb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821191452-yhcffb2","updated":"20240821191452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 539px;","style":"width: 529px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黍米"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黍米-20240821191452-d08t6nf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 529px;\" parent-style=\"width: 539px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 687px;","style":"width: 677px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黍米6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黍米6-20240627142856-z1iqqkx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 677px;\" parent-style=\"width: 687px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627135853-q52yey5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627135853-q52yey5","updated":"20240821191812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 616px;","style":"width: 606px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黍米3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黍米3-20240627141946-4pw7dji.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 606px;\" parent-style=\"width: 616px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 661px;","style":"width: 651px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黍米4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黍米4-20240627142517-mlmqcig.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 651px;\" parent-style=\"width: 661px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240612150339-kbsal6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150339-kbsal6y","updated":"20240627134628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：粟米和黍米虽然外观上都是鲜黄色的颗粒状米粒,但粟米的个头要比黍米更小一点。黍的种子表面以红褐色为多，也有少量为浅黄色；粟以浅黄色为主，均为黄色，粟颜色较浅。"}]},{"ID":"20240821191741-2r6rrmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821191741-2r6rrmf","updated":"20240821191751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：又名秫米，糜子米；"}]},{"ID":"20240612150339-hghav86","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150339-hghav86"}},{"ID":"20240612150535-rmf5x0m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150535-rmf5x0m","updated":"20240612150539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150535-bpaoykw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150535-bpaoykw","updated":"20240612150535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘温。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150535-uve3pkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150535-uve3pkb","updated":"20240612150535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主益气补中，多热，令人烦（《大观本》，作黑字，据《吴普》增）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150535-ear480n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150535-ear480n","updated":"20240612150535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：黍，神农甘无毒，七月取，阴干，益中补气。（《御览》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612150535-2bdskvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150535-2bdskvf","updated":"20240612150535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：黍、禾属而粘者，以大暑而种，故谓之黍。孔子曰：黍可为酒，禾入水也。《广雅》云：粢黍稻，其采谓之禾。齐氏要术引记胜之书曰：黍，忌丑，又曰黍，长于已，壮于酉，生于戍，老于亥，死于丑，恶于丙午，忌于丑寅卯，按黍，即糜之种也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150535-834siso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150535-834siso","updated":"20240612150535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上米谷，中品三种，旧二种，大小豆为二，无粟米黍米，今增。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150640-k8xazfd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150640-k8xazfd"}},{"ID":"20240612150642-ukz4uq0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150642-ukz4uq0","updated":"20240612150647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150642-ggh1o5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150642-ggh1o5z","updated":"20240612150642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」赤黍名门、糜，白黍中芑，黑黍中季节距，一稃二米名痞。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150642-wn0buur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150642-wn0buur","updated":"20240612150642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」黍米：甘、温、无毒。久食令人多热烦。丹黍米：甘、微寒、无毒。黍茎和根：辛、热、有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150642-1x71sug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150642-1x71sug","updated":"20240612150642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612150642-pxqp42f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150642-pxqp42f","updated":"20240612150642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米：烧灰和油涂跌打伤，能止痛，不作瘢；嚼浓汁，涂小儿鹅口疮，有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150642-7t9j9r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150642-7t9j9r1","updated":"20240612150642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丹黍米：止咳嗽，退热，亦治泄痢鳖瘕。黍茎和根：利小便，止喘，去浮肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150627-xmcyv4r","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150627-xmcyv4r"}},{"ID":"20240612150628-b7wgzo1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150628-b7wgzo1","updated":"20240612150635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150628-kdw55e4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150628-kdw55e4","updated":"20240612150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"稷之粘者。与稷一类二种。今俗通呼为黍子。不复呼稷矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150628-49n0y62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150628-49n0y62","updated":"20240612150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米气味甘温。主益气补中。（别录）黍者。暑也。以其象火。为南方之谷。性最粘滞。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150628-78gpy4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150628-78gpy4w","updated":"20240612150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其气〔论〕黍即稷之粘者。其苗似粟而低小。其粒如粟而光滑。有赤白黄黑数种。苗色亦然。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150628-csh9thc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150628-csh9thc","updated":"20240612150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"俱其粘滞与糯同性。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150628-zmcgfj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150628-zmcgfj9","updated":"20240612150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而别录云益气补"}]},{"ID":"20240612150616-yk3h55e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150616-yk3h55e"}},{"ID":"20240612150617-e57ck89","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150617-e57ck89","updated":"20240612150622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150617-lhewdd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150617-lhewdd6","updated":"20240612150617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味甘温，补中益气。久食，令人烦热。稷之粘腻者为黍。根，治心气疼。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150606-6irbi0p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150606-6irbi0p"}},{"ID":"20240612150607-yqr0tp4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150607-yqr0tp4","updated":"20240612150611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150607-akqbgrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150607-akqbgrg","updated":"20240612150607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘温。主益气补中。多热令人烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150607-xy6cerm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150607-xy6cerm","updated":"20240612150607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"精移火转。多黍丰蕃。新尝荐庙。春酿盈樽。起钟率度。吹律回温。设桃雪贱。谷长宜尊。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150607-795yev9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150607-795yev9","updated":"20240612150607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春秋说题辞。精移火转生黍。诗。丰年多黍多。礼。仲夏之月。天子以雏尝黍。先荐寝庙。说文。黍可为酒。从禾入水为意。曹邺诗。黑黍春来酿酒饮。汉书志。度者本起黄钟之长。以子谷黍中者。一黍之广。度之九十分。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150607-wdkoulg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150607-wdkoulg","updated":"20240612150607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄钟之长。列子。邹衍在燕。吹律而温气。至今传名曰黍谷。家语。鲁哀公以黍雪桃。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150607-aysac9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150607-aysac9t","updated":"20240612150607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孔子曰。黍五谷之长也。君子以贱雪贵。不闻以贵雪贱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150555-g28snap","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150555-g28snap"}},{"ID":"20240612150557-froskqu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150557-froskqu","updated":"20240612150602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150557-joxjk97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150557-joxjk97","updated":"20240612150557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，温，无毒。主益气，补中，多热，令人烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150544-roo4b1y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150544-roo4b1y"}},{"ID":"20240612150545-ipgs9x9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150545-ipgs9x9","updated":"20240612150551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150545-ggao6lu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150545-ggao6lu","updated":"20240612150545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，温，无毒。主益气，补中，多热，令人烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150545-a80z5ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150545-a80z5ke","updated":"20240612150545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荆、郢州及江北皆种此。其苗如芦而异于粟，粒亦大。粟而多是秫，今人又呼秫粟为黍，非酿黍米酒，则皆用秫黍也。又有 米与黍米相似，而粒殊大，食之不宜人，乃言发宿病。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150545-7ymy0i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150545-7ymy0i4","updated":"20240612150545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕黍有数种，以备注前条，今此通论黄黑黍米耳，亦全不似芦，虽似粟而非粟也。 即稷也，具释后条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150339-s77h4rn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150339-s77h4rn"}},{"ID":"20240612150526-q6oa4tt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150526-q6oa4tt","updated":"20240612150530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150526-9f57s0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150526-9f57s0o","updated":"20240612150526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，温，无毒．主益气，补中，多热令人烦．"}]},{"ID":"20240612150339-0afknki","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150339-0afknki"}},{"ID":"20240612150517-8bzhk9a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150517-8bzhk9a","updated":"20240612150520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150517-evwbt3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150517-evwbt3e","updated":"20240612150517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，温，无毒。主益气补中，多热，令人烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150517-4hx9ql8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150517-4hx9ql8","updated":"20240612150517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶荆、郢州及江北皆种此。其苗如芦而异于粟，粒亦大。粟而多是秫，今人又呼秫粟为黍，非也。北人作黍饭，方∶药酿黍米酒，则皆用秫黍也。又有 米与黍米相似，而粒殊大，食不宜人，言发宿病。唐本注云∶黍有数种，已备注前条，今此通论丹黑黍米尔，亦不即稷也，其释后条。臣禹锡等谨按孟诜云∶黍米，性寒。患鳖瘕者，以新熟赤黍米淘取泔汁，生服一升，不过三、两度愈。谨按性寒，有少毒。不堪久昏五脏，令人好睡。仙家重此。作酒最胜余粮。又，烧为灰，和油涂杖疮，不作KT ，止痛不能行。若与小猫，犬食之，其脚便 曲，行不正。缓人筋骨，绝血脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150517-wpekkws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150517-wpekkws","updated":"20240612150517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食疗云∶合葵菜食之，成痼疾。于黍米中藏干脯通。《食禁》云∶牛肉不得和黍米、白酒食之，必生寸白虫。千金方∶治人、六畜天行时气病，豌豆疮方∶浓煮黍穣汁洗之。一茎是穣则不瘥。疮若黑者，杵蒜封之。亦可煮干芸苔洗之。又方∶小儿鹅口，不能饮乳。以黍米汁敷之。又方∶妊娠尿血，黍穣茎烧灰，酒服方寸匕。肘后方∶食苦瓠中毒。煮黍穣汁解之，饮数升止。又方∶治汤火所灼未成疮。黍米、女曲等分，各熬令焦杵，下以鸡子白敷之。经验方∶治四十年心痛不瘥。黍米淘汁，温服，随多少。孙真人黍米，肺之谷也。肺病宜食。主益气。又方∶黍宜脉，不可久食之成痫。食医心镜∶益气安中，补不足，宜脉，不可久食，多热令人烦闷。白黍饭食之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150339-flq88lr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150339-flq88lr"}},{"ID":"20240612150505-kcxk0cd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150505-kcxk0cd","updated":"20240627135539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150505-o7awldh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150505-o7awldh","updated":"20240612150505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黍米益气味甘温，肺病相宜多则烦，赤者微苦止咳嗽，霍乱泄痢作粥餐，秫熟能润大肠燥，酿酒蜷急自然伸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150505-qe8f252","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150505-qe8f252","updated":"20240612150505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性宜高燥而寒，故北地有。似粟而非粟，谷之类也；似芦高丈余，穗黑色，实圆重。大概有二种，米粘者为秫，不粘者为黍。黍又有丹、赤、黑数种。无毒。肺之谷也，肺病宜食。益气安中，补不足，宜脉。不可久食，多热，令人烦闷昏，五脏好睡，发宿疾，缓筋骨，绝血脉。合葵菜食，成痼疾；合牛肉、白酒食，生寸白虫。赤黍米，皮赤米黄，味苦，微寒，无毒。主咳嗽咳逆，霍乱，止泄痢，除热止渴，下气。《衍义》云∶但可为糜，不堪为饭，粘着难脱，然亦动风。秫米，似黍米而粒小，即《诗》之所谓 也。性宜下湿而暑，故东南皆有之，宜作酒。肥软易消。故谓之软粟，又谓糯粟。味甘，微寒，无毒。止寒热，利大肠。能壅五脏气，动风，不可常食。又和菌陈、地黄酿酒服，治筋骨挛急；嚼烂涂疮疥、漆疮、冻疮，犬咬；又为末，鸡子白调涂肿毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150339-9a4zmda","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150339-9a4zmda"}},{"ID":"20240612150340-uddp9an","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-uddp9an","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：黍米"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-0rcmnm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-0rcmnm8","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-gmxxixj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-gmxxixj","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shǔ Mǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-qfseb1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-qfseb1c","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-1a34ij5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-1a34ij5","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-25hurhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-25hurhm","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-bvljshr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-bvljshr","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为禾本科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黍"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"种子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏，秋采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-yw06p8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-yw06p8a","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-dlmgimp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-dlmgimp","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 我国华北、西北多有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-i03yj3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-i03yj3j","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-p442frd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-p442frd","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黍（《诗经》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-100mk9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-100mk9e","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年生草本。秆直立，单生或少数丛生，高60～120厘米，有节，节上密生髭毛。叶鞘松弛，被疣毛；叶舌长约1毫米，具长约2毫米的纤毛；叶片线状披针形，长10～30厘米，宽1.5厘米，具柔毛或无毛，边缘常粗糙。圆锥花序，开展或较紧密，成熟则下垂，长约30厘米，分枝具角棱，边缘具粗糙刺毛，下部裸露，上部密生小枝与小穗；小穗卵状椭圆形，长约4～5毫米；颖纸质。无毛，第一颖长为小穗的1/2～2/3，先端尖或锥尖，具5～7脉，第二颖与小穗等长，大多为11脉；第一外稃形似第二颖；内稃薄膜质，较短小，长1.5～2毫米，先端常微凹。颖果圆形或椭圆形，平滑而有光泽，长约3毫米，乳白、淡黄或红色。种子白色、黄色或褐色，性粘或不粘。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-r2cp15u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-r2cp15u","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般分两种类型，以秆上有毛，偏穗，种子粘者为\"黍\"；秆上无毛，散穗，种子不粘者为\"稷\"。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-ljgkg4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-ljgkg4j","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的根（黍根）、茎（黍茎），以及稷的种子（稷米），稷的茎（糜穰）亦供药用，各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-cx2bn6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-cx2bn6r","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-wil3bmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-wil3bmv","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 去壳黍米含灰分2.86％，粗纤维6.25％，粗蛋白15.86％，淀粉59.65％。含油5.07％，其中脂肪酸，主为棕榈酸，以及廿四烷酸、十七烷酸、油酸、亚油酸、异亚油酸等。蛋白质有清蛋白、球蛋白、谷蛋白、醇溶蛋白等种类。黍米又含黍素。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-m8ws3pa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-m8ws3pa","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-dyhzwal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-dyhzwal","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草撮要》：\"入手足阳明、太阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-uo5rrbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-uo5rrbe","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-qd1vrgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-qd1vrgi","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-8ig9cxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-8ig9cxm","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《吴普本草》：\"甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-c6rebu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-c6rebu0","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"甘，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-cqvcm52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-cqvcm52","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《饮膳正要》：\"甘，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-60sj5hw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-60sj5hw","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"丹黍米：甘，微寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-qy8i2f9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-qy8i2f9","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-nw8rd86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-nw8rd86","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 益气补中。治泻痢，烦渴，吐逆，咳嗽，胃痛，小儿鹅口疮，烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-j1lespj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-j1lespj","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《吴普本草》：\"益气补中。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-m1yi2zc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-m1yi2zc","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"丹黍米，主咳逆，霍乱，止泄，除热，止烦渴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-auvj9c3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-auvj9c3","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③孟诜：\"患鳖瘕者，以新熟赤黍米淘取泔汁，生服一升。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-yex3sqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-yex3sqd","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-uyoo1w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-uyoo1w3","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤、煮粥或淘取泔汁。外用：研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-3nvyv6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-3nvyv6c","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-2dnqgrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-2dnqgrb","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小儿鹅口，不能饮乳：黍米汁涂之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-uljcsli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-uljcsli","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治汤火所灼未成疮者：黍米、女曲等分。各熬令黑如炭，捣末，以鸡子白和涂之。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-389bxuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-389bxuf","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-y95z9la","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-y95z9la","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-1x62bny","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-1x62bny","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：黍米"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-60lajhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-60lajhu","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-ypf37y7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-ypf37y7","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shǔ Mǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-ux8f0t2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-ux8f0t2","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-g0k3eyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-g0k3eyp","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 稷米、粢米、穄米、糜子米"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-5jtuevc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-5jtuevc","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-cycnmg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-cycnmg1","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Broomcorn Millet"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-rzlloz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-rzlloz6","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-ecsxwae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-ecsxwae","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.陶弘景：黍，荆、郢州及江北皆种此。其苗如芦，而异于粟，粒亦大。今人又呼称粟为黍，非也。北人作黍饭，方药酿黍米酒，则皆用秫黍也。丹黍米即赤黍米也，亦出北间，江东时有种而非土所宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-9tr68q5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-9tr68q5","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草衍义》：丹黍米，黍皮赤，其米黄，惟可为糜，不堪为饭。粘着难解，然亦动风。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-kirivjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-kirivjw","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《日用本草》： 丹黍米浙人呼为红莲米；江南多白黍，间有红者，呼为赤虾米。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-fwgnqh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-fwgnqh8","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《纲目》： 黍乃稷之粘者，亦有赤、"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-4pq3vbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-4pq3vbi","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-v5b8bra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-v5b8bra","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为禾本植物黍的种子"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-yoe147v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-yoe147v","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Panicum miliaceum. L"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-5kdeqb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-5kdeqb4","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季采收，碾去壳用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-qbiabno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-qbiabno","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-eupwcos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-eupwcos","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：我国东北、华北、西北、华南、西南以及华东等地山区都有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-5apws4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-5apws4q","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：我国东北、华北、西北、华南、西南以及华东等地山区都有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-i8ywlrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-i8ywlrx","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-1p22d69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-1p22d69","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黍，一年生栽培草本。秆粗壮，直立，单生或少数丛生，高60-120cm，有时有分枝，节密被髭毛，节下具疣毛。叶鞘松弛，被疣基毛；叶舌长约1mm，具长约2mm的纤毛；叶片线状披针形，长10-30cm，宽达1.5cm，具柔毛或无毛，边缘常粗糙。圆锥花序开展或国交紧密，成熟后下垂，长约30cm，分枝具角棱，边缘具糙刺毛，下部裸露，上部密生小枝与小穗；小穗卵状椭圆形，长4-5mm；颖纸质，无毛，第1颖长为小穗的1/2-2/3，先端尖，具5-7脉，第2颖与小穗等长，通常具11脉，其脉先端渐汇合成喙状；第1外稃形似第2颖，具11-13脉，内稃薄膜质，较短小，长1.5-2mm，先端微凹。谷粒圆形或椭圆形，长约3mm，乳白色或褐色。花、果期7-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-bkiyq2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-bkiyq2s","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-6khfu7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-6khfu7u","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 喜寒冷干燥气候。耐旱，耐盐碱。宜选择土质疏松、肥沃、排水良好的土壤栽培。 栽培技术 用种子每殖。2-3月播种。在整好的地上，按行距30-40cm开沟，沟深3-4cm，条播，播后覆土。 田间管理 苗期注意拔除杂草，收获前中耕除草2-3次，追肥1-2次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-p2pn30u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-p2pn30u","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-utmw7pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-utmw7pf","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 去壳黍米含灰分（ash）2.86%，精纤维（crudefiber）0.25%，粗蛋白（crude protein）15.86%，淀粉（starch）59.65%，含油5.07%，其中饱和脂肪酸生为棕榈酸（palmiticacid），二十四烷酸（carnaubic acid），十七烷酸（daturic acid），不饱和脂肪酸主要有油酸（oleic acid）亚油酸（linoleic acid），异亚油酸（isolinoleic aced）等。蛋白质（protein）主要有：白蛋白（albumin），球蛋白（globulin），谷蛋白（glutelin），醇溶谷蛋白（prolamine）等种类。黍米又含黍素（miliacin），鞣质（tannin）及肌醇六磷酸（phytate）等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-c7gufpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-c7gufpz","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-p1lbca3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-p1lbca3","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大肠；肺；胃；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-4k0367i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-4k0367i","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-fdaj4np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-fdaj4np","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘；微温"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-9l2305y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-9l2305y","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-5chqbgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-5chqbgv","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 益气补中；除烦止渴；解毒。主烦渴；泻痢；吐逆；咳嗽；胃痛；小儿鹅口疮；疮痈；烫伤"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-tnrk7wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-tnrk7wy","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-0y9snbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-0y9snbr","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，30-90g；煮粥或淘取泔汁。外用：适量，研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-9s0z1ik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-9s0z1ik","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-rux23ks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-rux23ks","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小儿鹅口，不能饮乳: 黍米汁涂之。 (《千金方》)②治汤火所灼未成疮者: 黍米、女曲等分。各熬令黑如炭，捣末，以鸡子白和涂之。 (《肘后方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-6r11172","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-6r11172","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-tfuwohr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-tfuwohr","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《吴普本草》：益气补中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-55ferd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-55ferd7","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：丹黍米，主咳逆，霍乱，止泄，除热，止烦渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-521mn8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-521mn8i","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.孟诜：患鳖瘕者， 以新熟赤黍米淘取泔汁，生服一升"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-31s5l10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-31s5l10","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612150340-670orda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150340-670orda","updated":"20240612150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612150341-mtrd5ay","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612150341-mtrd5ay"}},{"ID":"20240612150342-rrd7b0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612150342-rrd7b0b"}}]}